  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of agricultural export enabling infrastructure and extension services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The assessment will focus on the insufficient processing capacities to cater for the rising demand for food in Nepal. The project is in line with the Agriculture Development Strategy to lift trade-limiting infrastructure constraints in cold and dry storage and improve quality treatment, assessment, sanitary and phyto-sanitary testing.</narrative>
  </description>
